WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.407
Nde naange wurti, lo'ol wari e dabbaaji le'i fuu, ɓe o noddi ngam ɓe njooɗi nyaamdu.

00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:12.739
Ɓe ngi'i hoore higoojo ɗon yaha nder suudu, ɓernde maako boo ɗon ɗaɓɓa nder suudu.

00:00:12.819 --> 00:00:14.979
So ɗum woni rat giant famous!

00:00:15.059 --> 00:00:18.068
Sey ɓeynguure maɓɓiti, leɗɗe fuu njogii.

00:00:18.148 --> 00:00:27.644
Hyenniyanko'en ɗon duroo balɗe ɗuuɗɗe, ɓandu maako ɗon maaya, ngam to' o waawi wurtaago, nden ko'e maɓɓe ɗon nyaama nyaamdu.

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:32.663
Diga nyalnde nden, yimɓe ɗon mbi'a hyenna ɗon yaha bee hoore mum.
